  "text": "## Common Mistakes (Don't Make These!)  \n❌ **Mistake 1:** Ignoring a potential match and processing transaction anyway\n✅ **Correct:** Escalate to Compliance, do not process  \n❌ **Mistake 2:** Telling customer \"We're checking if you're on a sanctions list\"\n✅ **Correct:** Do not disclose screening to customer (tipping-off is illegal)  \n❌ **Mistake 3:** Closing account without investigation\n✅ **Correct:** Report suspicious activity to Compliance first  \n❌ **Mistake 4:** Only screening at account opening\n✅ **Correct:** Screen continuously throughout customer relationship  \n---",
